      "quote": "a blonde woman descends from a similar pose to a standing crouch and later stands with one arm extended across the cabin",
      "problem": "The blonde woman floats with one arm extended, lowers to a crouched stance, then rises again into a floating pose; she is not shown standing with an arm extended across the cabin."
    },
    {
      "quote": "a man cycles from a tucked float to an upright crouch and back to a horizontal float",
      "problem": "The man against the right wall is crouched or upright early and later lifts into a float; the frames do not show a cycle from a tucked float to a crouch and back."
    }
  ],
  "caption": "The video captures the curved, padded interior of a cabin seen through a wide-angle lens, where many people in dark flight suits occupy the space. Ceiling panels and a bundled rope on the left wall stay fixed, so the motion belongs to the occupants. Several are already drifting between horizontal floating poses and crouched, grounded stances in the cabin.\n\nIn the right foreground, a reddish-haired woman lowers from a floating pose until her feet touch the floor, settling into a crouch while extending an arm forward across the cabin. Behind her, a blonde woman floats with one arm extended, descends to a crouched stance, then rises again into a floating pose. Along the right wall, a man remains crouched against the padded surface for some time before lifting into a tucked float.\n\nIn the center, a few occupants remain crouched or seated on the floor, one holding a phone, while at the far-right edge a seated observer becomes visible holding a white-and-red megaphone.",
  "length_note": ""
}
